    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0438" n="348" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav02/pg348"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2499a</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-08-15T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                                1918, 1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Entire strength American expeditionary forces ordered Vladivostok as follows:</p>
                <p>Force consists of two regiments with a combined combatant strength of 7,398 men
                    with 251 officers. Attached to the force are noncombatants of complementary
                    units totaling 1,375 men in hospital, bakery, intelligence, ambulance, supply,
                    medical, telegraph, and similar bodies.</p>
                <p>Repeat to Peking and Vladivostok.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Lansing</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
